  "title": "Babcock & Wilcox Board Authorizes Share Repurchase Program of Up to $50 Million",
  "summary": "Babcock &amp; Wilcox Enterprises, Inc. today announced that its Board of Directors has authorized a share repurchase program of up to $50 million of the Company&#039;s outstanding common stock. The Company expects to begin repurchases following the filing of its Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the second quarter of 2026.",
